        },
        "quote": "ORDINANCE NO. 20667",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "6d64069c-7973-544d-b7f0-3ace3a1bc1e3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 551,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:2",
          "start": 73
        },
        "quote": "ORDINANCE introduced by City Manager Dr. Robert M. Perez amending the “District Map” referred to and made a part of the Zoning Ordinances by Section 18.50.050 of the Topeka Municipal Code, by providing for certain changes in zoning on 3.09 acres of property located at the southwest corner of the intersection of SW 21st Street & Topeka Boulevard FROM “M-1” Two-Family Dwelling District to “PUD” with C-4 use group, limited to automotive uses. (PUD26/01) (Council District No.3)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "eb24c405-49b7-51a4-82fd-3cda13d59a97",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 620,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:3",
          "start": 553
        },
        "quote": "BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "734e23b4-ae16-541e-b6b9-a542286d4ba3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 709,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:4",
          "start": 622
        },
        "quote": "Section 1. That the “District Map” referred to and made a part of the Zoning Ordinances",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "2c2a3d78-487f-5ef2-98f4-7d7ce01cdb07",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 854,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:5",
          "start": 711
        },
        "quote": "by Section 18.50.050 of the Topeka Municipal Code (TMC), be, and the same is hereby amended, by reclassifying the following described property:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "f1548ca7-5df4-5634-9c22-323b2b052ab7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1306,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:6",
          "start": 856
        },
        "quote": "LOTS 1 & 2 BLOCK A, LOT 1 BLOCK B, IN LADIES ADDITION No. 3, AND ALL ODD NUMBERED LOTS 759 THROUGH 809 ON TYLER STREET INCLUDING THE VACATED ALLEY ADJACENT THERETO, ODD NUMBERED LOTS 811-815 ON TYLER STREET INCLUDING VACATED STREETS AND ALLEYS ADJACENT THERETO, AND THE EAST 10 FEET OF EVEN NUMBERED LOTS 788 THROUGH 816 ON POLK STREET INCLUDING VACATED STREETS ADJACENT THERETO, ALL IN LADIES ADDITION, IN THE CITY OF TOPEKA, SHAWNEE COUNTY, KANSAS.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "49c0d5ee-d4d5-5a5d-abe3-0826564cfa9d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1319,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:7",
          "start": 1308
        },
        "quote": "subject to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "9878dd2a-250b-5ee0-b96d-02d1a99202f7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1450,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:8",
          "start": 1321
        },
        "quote": "1. Use and development of the site in accordance with the Laird Noller Planned Unit Development (PUD) Master Plan Amendment No. 1",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "02c092dd-a139-5379-be15-4455666dd65d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1542,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:9",
          "start": 1452
        },
        "quote": "Section 2. The PUD Master Plan for Laird Noller Amendment No. 1 shall be recorded with the",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "5c27c6f7-4ee3-530b-9d5f-d5935f884d5f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1908,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:10",
          "start": 1544
        },
        "quote": "Shawnee County Register of Deeds in accordance with Section 18.190.060(b) of the Topeka Municipal Code (TMC). Following the recording of the PUD Master Plan and prior to building permit and/or land development on the site, site development plans as required by the PUD Master Plan shall be submitted for review and administrative approval by the Planning Director.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "a468f0cd-7a80-5bb5-8734-12d53c70f42b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1982,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:11",
          "start": 1910
        },
        "quote": "Section 3. This Ordinance Number shall be fixed upon the “District Map”.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "f1d01ed9-6367-5315-b696-cf31bd80fbe9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2074,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:12",
          "start": 1984
        },
        "quote": "Section 4. All ordinances or parts of ordinances in conflict herewith are hereby repealed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "811f5f94-be6e-54a1-a81b-389e14cec0e0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2163,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:13",
          "start": 2076
        },
        "quote": "Section 5. This Ordinance shall take effect and be in force from and after its passage,",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "94377f96-02a8-5244-8ac5-e674b54c7374",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2221,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:14",
          "start": 2165
        },
        "quote": "approval and publication in the official city newspaper.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "20667 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "f2dd456c-81e4-5d08-8752-2d03c4f5ec1e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2298,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:15",
          "start": 2223
